{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晨朝畢，法師行香禮佛，班首執手磬，領大眾繞壇行道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外曷切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "都餓切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "途賣切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾序立佛前，作聲念。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師上座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師端莊整肅，觀想彌陀，作禮平舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺一下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾齊和五聲畢，再起五聲，去首四字畢，法師執罏拈香。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三聲畢，法師執水盂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉廿露王如來加持呪水和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉大悲呪，洒淨念偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師揚鈴宣念各讚後，大眾和歌佛號。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺，班首宣讀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某省某府某縣某都"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "家庭某菴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺舉揚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歌揚佛號法，班首舉念，大眾齊和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五聲畢，別起五聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或小彌陀經代"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉佛號三聲，三鳴尺，三問訊，大眾默坐聽講。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉阿彌陀佛身金色坐持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五百聲，法師鳴尺舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各十聲畢唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三聲稍止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師班首下座，運動法樂，繞旋行道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五百聲畢，眾復位，法師上座鳴尺一下，舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各十聲唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上來啟建三時，繫念\n淨業道場。今當第一時，佛事已圓。眾等捧誦大阿彌陀\n經往生神呪，稱念阿彌陀佛萬德洪名一千聲，及舉列聖\n洪名各二十聲。如上殊勳，投入彌陀大願海中。功德良\n因，專為某等消除已誤之愆，蕩滌輕重之罪。捨此報身，\n第生淨土。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "班首舉偈，眾跪應和。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師想四聖端坐金臺，證明發願。班首舉偈，眾復跪和。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師執水孟淨食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遍洒法筵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師揚鈴宣念，各讚後，眾和佛號五聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱，舉諸如來名，回向"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "班首宣讀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲子吉日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某寺家庭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "年　月　日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或小彌陀經代"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三舉佛，三鳴尺，三問訊，眾靜坐聽講。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鳴尺，不起座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坐持佛號同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行道課佛如前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上來啟建三時繫念淨業道場。今當\n第二時，佛事已圓，一眾捧演大彌陀經往生神呪，人各\n種念阿彌陀佛萬德洪名一千聲，及稱觀世音、大勢至、\n清淨海眾菩薩名號各二十聲。如上殊勳，投入如來大\n願海中。出生功德，專為杲等消災滅罪，捨此報身，徑生\n淨土。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "班首舉偈，大眾\n跪和。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "班首舉偈，大眾跪和。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮讖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮佛四十八拜，按如來四十八願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師合掌，定立，平舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛前燒香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "供養三寶，唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "班首先舉，大眾跪和。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師執罏舉念，大眾和拜。"}
