{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繞旋行道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齊和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "啞吽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "啞吽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三歸，唱云：各一拜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或小彌陀經代"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三舉佛，三鳴尺，三問訊，靜坐，聽講。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坐持佛號同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行道課佛如前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾等依憑教法，作三時繫念佛事。捧誦觀\n無量壽經，往生淨土神呪。稱念樂邦教主，萬德洪名。講演大乘第一義諦，決定往生法要。及開啟迴向，懺悔發\n願，作種種佛事，所集勝因。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾跪，和念後偈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師鳴尺，大眾跪和。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨土文，回向"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雪峯頌：一盞孤燈照夜臺，上牀\n脫了韈和鞋。三魂六魄夢中去，未委明朝來不來。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "張魁詩云：紅紅白白莫相瞞，無位真人赤肉團。敗壞不如猪狗相，只今便作死屍看。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨土文：皮包血肉骨纏筋，顛倒凡夫認作身。到死始知非是我，從前金玉付他人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古頌：父母恩深終有別，夫妻義重也分離。人情似鳥同林宿，大限來時各自飛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "延光集：鑊湯罏炭喧幽壤，劍樹刀山聳太清。受罪要終八萬劫，獄卒牛頭\n始放行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寒山頌：胭脂𦘕面嬌千樣，龍󴊋熏衣悄百般。今日風流都不見，綠楊芳草髑髏\n寒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寒山云：雀󲣅鵶飡皮肉盡，風吹日灸\n髑髏乾。目前試問傍觀者，自把形骸仔細觀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寒山\n云：百骸漬散雜塵泥，一物長靈復是誰？不得此時通線路，骷髏著地幾人知？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
